  <Intro>k__BackingField: A bone dragon is only as great as the dragon it was. The oldest wyrm in the land sleeps in the Mosswood, and the clans of the wood worship it. Wake it, and kill it.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The wyrm falls in the moss. Before dawn its bones stand up again, and they are yours.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Slay the green wyrm of the Mosswood.
